    "name": {
      "value": "Trapsmith"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "g&g"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Wielding a wrench or blowtorch, you manufacture snares that whir and tick with delicate precision. Your best work requires the right materials—a glorious set of brass fittings and cogwheels—with which you create snares that are as elegantly lethal as they are subtle. As a trapsmith, you're always improving your snares: adjusting timing, tweaking triggers, and finding new ways to hide them from foes.\n\nYou can select the dedication feat for the trapsmith archetype even if you haven't yet gained three feats from the snarecrafter archetype."
    },
